Version 1.01a (October 1, 2026)
-------------------------------
* Converted to native nftables for Arno's (NFT) Firewall (rules in table inet anf)
* Rules are no longer removed when stopping, (re)start and stop replace the whole ruleset atomically
* Conntrack/NAT helper via load_conntrack_helper_module (explicit ct helper assignment)

Version 1.01 (June 15, 2017)
----------------------------
+ Add support for v2.0.2 using the CONNTRACK_HELPER chain

Version 1.00 (January 9, 2016)
------------------------------
+ Initial version

